{"counts":{"canonical":16,"context":0,"total":16,"unknown_date":0,"unlinked":0},"events":[{"aliases":["Chinchorro","丧葬","遗体处理"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["钦乔罗文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5497db2bba26e3b36f16fc2b","summary":"钦乔罗文化的海洋狩猎采集群体，约在公元前5450至前890年生活于今智利北部干旱的阿塔卡马沿海。海洋资源是其生计的重要基础，遗址中发现用骨、贝壳以及矿物和植物材料制作的工具，也保存了格外复杂的葬俗证据。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5450—前890年","end_year":-890,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5450},"title":"钦乔罗海洋采集群体发展人工木乃伊葬俗"},{"aliases":["Prehistoric Pile Dwellings around the Alps","居住建筑","环境利用"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-843c3d0b25516b22aa225af7","summary":"约公元前5000至前500年，阿尔卑斯及周边人群在湖岸、河边和湿地附近营建桩上聚落。列入世界遗产的系列包含多个国家的一百余处遗址，记录了新石器时代至青铜时代不同群体的居住方式。它们不是一座持续存在的城市，而是一组跨越漫长时期的聚落材料。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前500年","end_year":-500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"阿尔卑斯周边群体营建水边桩上聚落"},{"aliases":["Stonehenge, Avebury and Associated Sites","巨石建筑","葬俗"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-43cecb4a48bf8b2c4103592d","images":[{"caption":"巨石阵现存遗迹，Diego Delso于2014年摄影。","c